# Three developers on mixed platforms (Dev A is on Windows). Without this, every
# checkout rewrites line endings and diffs fill with whole-file changes that hide
# the real edit. Normalise to LF in the repo; Git converts on checkout as needed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary

# Generated. Collapse in diffs and don't count toward language stats.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
